    "body": "In my numbered list of steps, \"process the iframe attributes\" runs twice.  The first time between steps 2 and 3 (which is when the insertion happens).  The second time at step 4, at which point it's in the document and has a browsing context and has `/common/blank/html` loaded in that browsing context and so forth.",
